"You already paid. Here's your change.": "您已经付过了。这是找您的零钱。",
"You can ask that at the airport. Small or large?": "这个你得去机场问。小杯还是大杯？",
"You can sit anywhere. How will you pay?": "随便坐。你怎么付款？",
"You do not need a reservation here. How many tacos should I make?": "这里不用预订。我给您做几个塔可？",
"You got it. Which salsa should I add?": "好嘞。加什么酱？",
"You haven't eaten yet! What will you drink?": "你们还没吃呢！喝点什么？",
"You speak very well!": "你说得很好！",
"You too. Come back soon!": "你也是。欢迎再来！",
"You too. See you!": "您也是。再见！",
"You'll like it, you'll see.": "你会喜欢的，等着瞧。",
"You're doing great.": "你学得很好。",
"You're one of us!": "你真是自己人了！",
"You're very kind. Thanks.": "您真好。谢谢。",
"You're welcome. Take care!": "不客气。保重！",
"You're welcome. Welcome to Mexico!": "不客气。欢迎来到墨西哥！",
"You've already eaten, haha. Will you add the tip?": "你们已经吃过了，哈哈。要加小费吗？",
"You've already eaten. How was everything?": "你们已经吃完了。吃得怎么样？",
"Your coffee is already ordered. Is it your first time here?": "你的咖啡已经点好了。你是第一次来吗？",
"Your room is 305, on the third floor.": "您的房间是305，在三楼。",
"“A la izquierda” is left; “a la derecha” is right.": "“A la izquierda”是左边；“a la derecha”是右边。",
"“A pie” means on foot. “En metro” means by metro.": "“A pie”是步行，“En metro”是坐地铁。",
"“Afuera” means outside; “adentro” means inside.": "“Afuera”是外面；“adentro”是里面。",
"“Aparte” means on the side.": "“Aparte”是另放的意思。",
"“Bien cocida” is well done; “término medio” is medium.": "“Bien cocida”是全熟；“término medio”是五分熟。",
"“Boleto” means ticket.": "“Boleto”是票的意思。",
"“Caliente” means hot. “Con hielo” means with ice.": "“Caliente”是热的。“Con hielo”是加冰。",
"“Chica” means small.": "“Chica”是小的意思。",
"“Con tarjeta” means by card; “en efectivo” means in cash.": "“Con tarjeta”是刷卡；“en efectivo”是现金。",
"“De vacaciones” means on vacation.": "“De vacaciones”是度假的意思。",
"“En efectivo” is cash; “con tarjeta” is by card.": "“En efectivo”是现金；“con tarjeta”是刷卡。",
"“Entrada” is a starter.": "“Entrada”是前菜。",
"“Equipaje” means luggage.": "“Equipaje”是行李的意思。",
"“Eso es todo” means “That is all.”": "“Eso es todo”意思是“就这些。”",
"“Estoy buscando…” means “I am looking for…”": "“Estoy buscando…”意思是“我在找……”",
"“Factura” is an official receipt; “ticket” is a simple one.": "“Factura”是正式发票；“ticket”是普通小票。",
"“Firmar” means to sign.": "“Firmar”是签字的意思。",
"“Grande” is large. “Pequeño” is small.": "“Grande”是大，“Pequeño”是小。",
"“Hermanos” can mean siblings.": "“Hermanos”可以指兄弟姐妹。",
"“La clave” means the password.": "“La clave”是密码的意思。",
"“Llevo… meses” means I've been… months.": "“Llevo… meses”意思是我学了……个月。",
"“Maletas” means suitcases.": "“Maletas”是行李箱的意思。",
"“Me da…” is a natural, polite way to order.": "“Me da…”是自然又礼貌的点单说法。",
"“Mucho gusto” is a friendly way to say “Nice to meet you.”": "“Mucho gusto”是“很高兴认识你”的亲切说法。",
"“Nada más” means nothing else.": "“Nada más”是没有别的了的意思。",
"“No me molesta” means it doesn't bother me.": "“No me molesta”意思是我不介意。",
"“Nos conocimos…” means “We met…”": "“Nos conocimos…”意思是“我们是……认识的”",
"“Pan dulce” is Mexican sweet bread.": "“Pan dulce”是墨西哥甜面包。",
"“Para llevar” means to go.": "“Para llevar”是带走的意思。",
"“Para llevar” means to take away.": "“Para llevar”是带走的意思。",
"“Parque” means park.": "“Parque”是公园的意思。",
"“Picar” means to be spicy.": "“Picar”是辣的意思。",
"“Por separado” means separately.": "“Por separado”是分开的意思。",
"“Postre” means dessert.": "“Postre”是甜点的意思。",
"“Prefiero el taxi” means “I prefer the taxi.”": "“Prefiero el taxi”意思是“我更想打车。”",
"“Primera vez” means first time.": "“Primera vez”是第一次的意思。",
"“Repetir” means to repeat.": "“Repetir”是重复的意思。",
"“Servilletas” are napkins.": "“Servilletas”是餐巾纸。",
"“Sin cebolla” means “without onion.”": "“Sin cebolla”意思是“不要洋葱。”",
"“Soy de…” means “I am from…”": "“Soy de…”意思是“我来自……”",
"“Sí, tengo una reservación” means “Yes, I have a reservation.”": "“Sí, tengo una reservación”意思是“是的，我有预订。”",
"“Una mesa para…” means “A table for…”": "“Una mesa para…”意思是“一张……人的桌子”",
"“Una noche” is one night. “Dos noches” is two nights.": "“Una noche”是一晚，“Dos noches”是两晚。",
"“Vista” means view.": "“Vista”是景观的意思。",
"“Ya” means already.": "“Ya”是已经的意思。",
"“¿Qué me recomienda?” is a handy way to ask for a recommendation.": "“¿Qué me recomienda?”是请人推荐的好用说法。"
